# `cargo cicd target show`

Reports the size and age profile of the local Cargo target directory without modifying it.

**Noun:** `target` &nbsp;&nbsp; **Verb:** `show`

<!-- END ggen:command-reference -->

<!-- BEGIN custom:examples -->
## Examples

```sh
cargo cicd target show
```
<!-- END custom:examples -->
